* TL431 programmable shunt reference - schemaitic placeholder subckt.
* Simple behavioural stand-in (cathode reference impedance + bias) so designs
* simulate before a vendor-grade model is dropped in. Replace with the
* manufacturer's .lib when one is available; the pin order must stay
* CATHODE ANODE REFERENCE to match TL431.kicad_sym.
.subckt TL431 CATHODE ANODE REFERENCE
RZ CATHODE ANODE 18
RB CATHODE REFERENCE 1e6
.ends TL431
